-> adk api_server

ReACT
Reasoning(Internal analysis)-> Act(Api calls)-> Observe(Results)->Adjust/Decide(Loop back to Reason)

Three agent behaviour patterns:
-> Sequential agents(one after another like an assembly line; predictable but rigid)
-> Reactive agents(analyse what to do next)
-> Planning agents(Sketch out the plan first and then execute)


